  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AA Nafaka Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: AA Nafaka is categorized as a Small and Medium Enterprise (SME) engaged in food processing of maize flour, rice and vegetable oil. .Beneficiaries: AA Nafakastore is woman-owned and it&apos;s intended to benefit more than 4,300 beneficiaries the majority of whom are women..Description: The enterprise operates a food value chain that involves contracted farmers, input suppliers, transporters, processing facilities for edible oil and paddy at Mlowo in Songwe and fortified maize flour in Dar es Salaam. The project involves expansion and scaling-up as a result of increased demand. This also involves operating more efficiently by acquiring own transport and creating an inputs and crop fund so as to meet farmers demand for quality inputs and on time.</narrative>
  </description>
